      {
       "data": "\"\\\\frac{\\\\frac{\\\\gamma  l (l+1) P^2 (1-U) \\\\left(\\\\gamma  P-G \\\\xi ^2 (U-1)^2\\\\right) \\\\left(\\\\gamma  \\\\xi  P (U-1)-G \\\\xi ^3 (U-1)^3\\\\right) \\\\left(G^2 (q+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  (U-1)) \\\\left(\\\\delta +q+\\\\xi  U'+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  (U-1)+2 U-1\\\\right)+G' \\\\left(P'-G \\\\xi  (U-1) \\\\left(\\\\delta +q+\\\\xi  U'+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  (U-1)+2 U-1\\\\right)\\\\right)\\\\right)}{\\\\xi ^2}-\\\\frac{(U-1)^2 (-\\\\delta +\\\\lambda  \\\\xi -q-U (\\\\lambda  \\\\xi +2)+1) \\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\gamma  P-G \\\\xi ^2 (U-1)^2\\\\right)^5 \\\\left(G^2 \\\\left(P' \\\\left(-G \\\\xi ^3 (U-1) U' \\\\left(\\\\delta -2 \\\\lambda  \\\\xi +2 q+\\\\xi  U'+2 \\\\lambda  \\\\xi  U+5 U-\\\\omega -1\\\\right)-G \\\\xi ^2 (U-1) (\\\\delta +q+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  (U-1)+2 U-1) (-\\\\lambda  \\\\xi +q+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  U+3 U-\\\\omega )+P (\\\\lambda  \\\\xi +3) (q+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  (U-1))\\\\right)+G \\\\xi ^2 P U' (q+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  (U-1)) \\\\left(\\\\delta -2 \\\\lambda  \\\\xi +2 q+\\\\xi  U'+2 \\\\lambda  \\\\xi  U+5 U-\\\\omega -1\\\\right)-\\\\xi  (U-1) (\\\\lambda  \\\\xi +3) \\\\left(P'\\\\right)^2\\\\right)+\\\\gamma  \\\\lambda  \\\\xi ^2 P^2 (U-1) \\\\left(G'\\\\right)^2+G \\\\xi  G' \\\\left(\\\\gamma  \\\\lambda  P^2 \\\\left(-\\\\lambda  \\\\xi +\\\\xi  U'+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  U+6 U-\\\\omega -3\\\\right)+P P' (q+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  (U-1))+\\\\left(P'\\\\right)^2 (\\\\xi -\\\\xi  U)\\\\right)\\\\right)-G^2 P (q+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  (U-1)) \\\\left(G \\\\xi ^2 (U-1)^2-\\\\gamma  P\\\\right)^5 (G \\\\xi  (\\\\delta +q+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  (U-1)+2 U-1) (-\\\\lambda  \\\\xi +q+\\\\lambda  \\\\xi  U+3 U-\\\\omega )-\\\\gamma  \\\\lambda  P (\\\\lambda  \\\\xi +3))\\\\right)}{\\\\left(G \\\\xi ^2 (U-1)^2-\\\\gamma  P\\\\right)^3}}{G^2 P (U-1)^4 \\\\left(\\\\gamma  \\\\xi  P-G \\\\xi ^3 (U-1)^2\\\\right)^3}\"",
